# Code owners for this repository.
#
# GitHub requests review from an owner automatically, and the branch protection
# rule requires an approving review from one. Replace the handles below before
# using this template for a real pack: a CODEOWNERS file naming someone who does
# not maintain the repository is worse than none, because it routes review to a
# person who will not do it.
#
# Entries are last-match-wins, so put the general rule first and narrow after.

# Everything, by default.
*                       @your-handle

# Uncomment and adjust as the pack grows.
# /chart/               @your-handle
# /docs/                @your-handle
# /.github/workflows/   @your-handle

# Files the repository standards require. Losing one silently breaks
# conformance, so review them deliberately.
/pack-metadata.yaml     @your-handle
/GOVERNANCE.md          @your-handle
/MAINTAINERS.md         @your-handle
/SECURITY.md            @your-handle
